@host = http://localhost:5085

### 1. Cadastrar o presidente
# @name president
POST {{host}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Marcelo" }

### 2. Cadastrar mais três jogadores
# @name joao
POST {{host}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "João" }

###
# @name pedro
POST {{host}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Pedro" }

###
# @name lucas
POST {{host}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lucas" }

### 3. Criar o grupo (o presidente entra como mensalista e no rodízio)
# @name group
POST {{host}}/api/groups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Teste manual", "playersPerTeam": 2, "benchPlayersPerTeam": 0, "matchDay": "Tuesday", "presidentId": "{{president.response.body.$.id}}" }

### 4. Adicionar membros
POST {{host}}/api/groups/{{group.response.body.$.id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{joao.response.body.$.id}}", "type": "Regular" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/groups/{{group.response.body.$.id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{pedro.response.body.$.id}}", "type": "Substitute" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/groups/{{group.response.body.$.id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{lucas.response.body.$.id}}", "type": "Substitute" }

### 5. Criar a dupla Marcelo + João
POST {{host}}/api/groups/{{group.response.body.$.id}}/pairs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstPlayerId": "{{president.response.body.$.id}}", "secondPlayerId": "{{joao.response.body.$.id}}" }

### 6. Criar a temporada (6 meses)
# @name season
POST {{host}}/api/groups/{{group.response.body.$.id}}/seasons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "2026/2", "start": "2026-07-01" }

### 7. Abrir a lista (mensalistas aparecem em "pending")
# @name list
POST {{host}}/api/groups/{{group.response.body.$.id}}/lists
Content-Type: application/json

{ "matchDate": "2026-10-20" }

### 8. Todos confirmam presença
POST {{host}}/api/lists/{{list.response.body.$.id}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{president.response.body.$.id}}", "positions": ["Defender"] }

###
POST {{host}}/api/lists/{{list.response.body.$.id}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{joao.response.body.$.id}}", "positions": ["Midfielder", "Forward"] }

###
POST {{host}}/api/lists/{{list.response.body.$.id}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{pedro.response.body.$.id}}", "positions": ["Goalkeeper"] }

###
POST {{host}}/api/lists/{{list.response.body.$.id}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{lucas.response.body.$.id}}", "positions": ["Forward"] }

### 9. Ver a lista (4 em "playing", 0 vagas abertas)
GET {{host}}/api/lists/{{list.response.body.$.id}}

### 10. Fechar a lista
POST {{host}}/api/lists/{{list.response.body.$.id}}/close

### 11. Iniciar a escalação (professor: Marcelo; parceiro: João)
# @name lineup
POST {{host}}/api/lists/{{list.response.body.$.id}}/lineup

### 12. O professor divide os outros jogadores
PUT {{host}}/api/lineups/{{lineup.response.body.$.id}}/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "teamA": ["{{pedro.response.body.$.id}}"], "teamB": ["{{lucas.response.body.$.id}}"] }

### 13. O parceiro escolhe o time A (o professor vai para o B)
POST {{host}}/api/lineups/{{lineup.response.body.$.id}}/choice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "team": "A" }

### 14. Registrar o resultado (time A venceu)
# @name match
POST {{host}}/api/lineups/{{lineup.response.body.$.id}}/match
Content-Type: application/json

{ "goalsA": 3, "goalsB": 1 }

### 15. Ranking (João e Pedro em 1º com 3 pontos)
GET {{host}}/api/seasons/{{season.response.body.$.id}}/ranking

### 16. Grupo: Marcelo foi para o fim do rodízio
GET {{host}}/api/groups/{{group.response.body.$.id}}

### Erros: abrir de novo a lista da mesma data → 409
POST {{host}}/api/groups/{{group.response.body.$.id}}/lists
Content-Type: application/json

{ "matchDate": "2026-10-20" }

### Erros: inscrição sem posição → 400 com "errors"
POST {{host}}/api/lists/{{list.response.body.$.id}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{pedro.response.body.$.id}}", "positions": [] }

### Erros: inscrever na lista fechada → 422
POST {{host}}/api/lists/{{list.response.body.$.id}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "playerId": "{{pedro.response.body.$.id}}", "positions": ["Forward"] }

### Documento OpenAPI
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
